# Rescuing Ryn from the Monastery (Milestone 20b, any other start). Plays on
# reaching Ryn's rune after the Corrupted Grandmaster is beaten.

face player up
emote ryn !
say Ryn: You beat the Grandmaster? Then it's over. I trained under that old master for years... that wasn't them anymore.
say Ryn: Frank sent you? Then the rest of us are still out there somewhere.
emote ryn note
say Ryn: Count me in. My fists are yours - and I can patch you up, too.
join ryn
despawn ryn
sound level_up
narrate Ryn joins the party!
set cleared_monastery
